# `CF412_TRIAL=<steps>` runs the whole pipeline at a few tens of backbone
# steps. Its score is a wiring check, not a measurement, and a trial file
# beside the study's own results is one glob away from being read as a study
# number.
#
# Three files are the exception, and they are committed. `smoke.csv` and
# `smoke.log` carry the shape each arm's trainer actually ran, the
# depth-column count, the memory and the step time the run plan is sized from.
# `trial.log` carries the end-to-end pass through the head and the
# evaluation.
results/trial/*
!results/trial/smoke.csv
!results/trial/smoke.log
!results/trial/trial.log
